OL,3,GNEWSABoy who stabbed girl at school was
OL,4,Aradicalised online, says father
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: The following report contains
OL,7,Fdetails that some may find distressing
OL,9,FThe father of a teenager who tried to
OL,10,Fkill a fellow pupil in a school knife
OL,11,Fattack has described his devastation
OL,12,Fand belief that his son was
OL,13,F"radicalised" by extreme material
OL,14,Fonline.
OL,16,FThe boy, now 16, was found guilty of
OL,17,Fattempted murder last week after a
OL,18,Ftrial heard how he harboured a hatred
OL,19,Fof women, had a fascination with serial
OL,20,Fkillers and had planned to target
OL,21,Fothers in the attack at Thorpe St
OL,22,FAndrew School, near Norwich.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
