OL,3,GNEWSABoy who stabbed girl at school was
OL,4,Aradicalised online, says father
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking exclusively to the BBC and
OL,7,Fcalling for tighter controls, the boy's
OL,8,Ffather said he did not want to
OL,9,F"absolve" his son but suggested online
OL,10,Fmaterial and "a culture of violence and
OL,11,Fhorror" had influenced him.
